        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Don't Crush: Death Counter Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer platformer designed for friends who love to mess with each other! Every death is a test of friendship, and dying isn't the end - it's the beginning of social embarrassment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Precision Jumping Challenge: Advanced double-jump mechanics with wall-bouncing techniques</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiplayer Trolling System: Real-time death counter that exposes every &quot;useless teammate&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Infinite Revival Mechanic: 1-second respawn with no penalties, but death count is permanently recorded</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cross-Platform Multiplayer: Steam and Epic Games Store players can play together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Game Highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 30+ creative levels with unique challenges and traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock &quot;Useless Teammate Badge&quot; after 100 deaths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Support for 2 players in multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Real-time voice chat for maximum trolling fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Perfect For</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Plastic Friendship: Friends who pretend to cooperate but secretly compete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hardcore Players: Those seeking no-damage speedrun challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Social Anxiety Relief: Building friendships through mutual trolling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Being bad at games isn't scary - what's scary is who dies more!&quot; Ready for the ultimate test of friendship?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Technical Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Built with Unreal Engine 5.5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cross-platform multiplayer support (Steam + Epic Games Store)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Optimized network synchronization for smooth multiplayer experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Available on Windows and Android platforms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the death counter carnival and see who's the real &quot;team IQ ceiling&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
